README.md:25:Project search and Search projects filter project names alongside the Active/Archived filter. Task search and Search tasks filter titles alongside completion, priority, and the applied due range. Both use substring matching that ignores ASCII letter case and trims surrounding query whitespace only; internal whitespace and non-ASCII case remain significant. Blank queries match everything allowed by the other filters. Applied queries travel in URLs and hidden form fields, never in stored task data. Task edits and moves retain the query and re-evaluate membership without changing summary counts. Search stays usable in archived projects. Opening the list through Projects or opening a project from the list starts with an empty query.
